🎉 PHP 8.6.0 Beta 1 is available for testing!

This is the first beta for PHP 8.6, including

- First set of PHP 8.6 deprecations
- Time\Duration class + Time\TimeException
- Readonly properties
- Closure optimizations

… and more!

➕ Do: Test your projects!

➖ Don't: Run it in production. It's not fully ready yet.

This marks PHP 8.6 Soft feature freeze: all RFCs must have their voting concluded

🔗 https://www.php.net/archive/2026.php#2026-08-13-1

